  "card": "This pull request fixes wallet targeting bugs in two functional tests. In wallet_keypool_topup.py, hardcoded paths caused nodes 2 through 4 to restart using their original wallets rather than backups, leaving keypool restoration for p2sh-segwit, bech32, and bech32m output types unexercised since commit 0dcac51049. In wallet_createwallet.py, a typo caused the test to re-check an earlier wallet instead of verifying that the avoid_reuse wallet was created unencrypted. The fix backs up and restores each node's own wallet, asserts a rescan occurred on restart, and fixes the variable reference in wallet_createwallet.py.",
